### Create a match date for an event (replace with actual event ID)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/match-dates
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "name": "Fecha 1",
  "date": "2026-03-15",
  "status": "UPCOMING"
}

### Create another match date
POST http://localhost:8080/api/match-dates
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "name": "Fecha 2",
  "date": "2026-03-30",
  "status": "UPCOMING"
}

### Get all match dates for an event (replace with actual event ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/match-dates/by-event/REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get match dates of a specific event where a club is registered (replace with actual IDs)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/match-dates/by-event/1/club/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
